          <li><a href="#compare-title">how it compares</a></li>
          <li><a href="#anti-mcp-title">why CLI, not MCP</a></li>
          <li><a href="#anti-persona-title">not for you?</a></li>
          <li><a href="#sustainability-title">sustainability</a></li>
          <li><a href="#commands">commands</a></li>
