          <p class="bench-headline">
            <strong>Pick metalmind</strong> when your notes are the source of truth and you
            want Claude Code to read them verbatim with zero standing tax. Pick
            <strong>mem0</strong> for fact extraction from conversations. Pick
            <strong>Letta</strong> or <strong>Mastra</strong> when you're building agents
