      <section class="container section-prose" aria-labelledby="how-title" id="how">
        <h2 id="how-title">
          <span class="scadrial-only">Under the metalmind</span>
          <span class="classic-only">Under the hood</span>
        </h2>
        <p>
          One verb, one job. Each engine is swappable — so if a backend gets replaced later, your
          muscle memory doesn't move. Your notes, embeddings, and code graphs never leave your
          machine.
        </p>
        <div class="diagram">
          <div class="diagram-node">
            <div class="diagram-node-title">Vault</div>
            <div class="diagram-node-body">
              Obsidian at <code>~/Knowledge/</code>. <code>sqlite-vec</code> + fastembed
              (<code>BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5</code>) run in-process — no Docker, no daemon.
              Incremental watcher re-embeds only changed files; queries stay answerable
              throughout reindex.
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="diagram-node">
            <div class="diagram-node-title">Serena</div>
